    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They left you for dead. Now, <strong>unleash the Nanostorm</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nanostorm</strong> is an incremental 2D arcade shoot'em'up game where you get stronger with every death. In the game, defeated enemies drop Nano-Essence, which you can spend in a <strong>massive skill tree</strong> on new abilities and powerful perks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A hostile alien world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded and alone after crash-landing on a deadly alien world, you discover that death isn't the end \u2013 it's the fuel for your rebirth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Nanostorm, a <strong>fast-paced</strong>, horizontal <strong>incremental shoot'em'up</strong>. Obliterate endless waves of vicious pixel-art monsters and harvest the vital nano essence they bleed. Pour this essence into a vast skill tree, unlocking game-changing perks that transform you into an unstoppable force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>You start weak, but soon you will evolve into the storm</strong></u>. Gather enough strength to finally activate your ship's emergency warp core and escape this forsaken planet!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They left you for dead. Now, <strong>unleash the Nanostorm</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nanostorm</strong> is an incremental 2D arcade shoot'em'up game where you get stronger with every death. In the game, defeated enemies drop Nano-Essence, which you can spend in a <strong>massive skill tree</strong> on new abilities and powerful perks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A hostile alien world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded and alone after crash-landing on a deadly alien world, you discover that death isn't the end \u2013 it's the fuel for your rebirth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Nanostorm, a <strong>fast-paced</strong>, horizontal <strong>incremental shoot'em'up</strong>. Obliterate endless waves of vicious pixel-art monsters and harvest the vital nano essence they bleed. Pour this essence into a vast skill tree, unlocking game-changing perks that transform you into an unstoppable force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>You start weak, but soon you will evolve into the storm</strong></u>. Gather enough strength to finally activate your ship's emergency warp core and escape this forsaken planet!</p>",
